<view class="page"><block wx:if="{{directUpload}}"><view class="action-intro"><view class="eyebrow">REAL FOOD PHOTO</view><view class="title">上传这道菜的实拍图</view><view class="muted">真实照片会帮助更多同学找到好吃的。</view></view><view class="upload-card"><view class="choice-top"><view class="choice-icon">📷</view><view><view class="choice-title">给这道菜留张实拍</view><view class="muted">审核通过后，会帮助更多同学点餐</view></view></view><view class="photo-box" bindtap="choosePhoto"><image wx:if="{{pickedPath}}" src="{{pickedPath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else><text>＋</text><view>拍照或从相册选择</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{fileSizeText}}" class="muted">已自动压缩至 {{fileSizeText}}</view><input placeholder="这道菜叫什么？" value="{{dishName}}" bindinput="inputName"/><button class="primary-btn" loading="{{uploading}}" bindtap="upload">提交这张实拍图</button></view></block><block wx:else><view class="decision-page"><view class="decision-center-card"><view class="eyebrow">MEAL DECISION</view><view class="action-dice"><view class="dot one"></view><view class="dot two"></view><view class="dot three"></view><view class="dot four"></view></view><view class="title">今天吃什么？</view><view class="muted">还没想好就交给一点运气，按现在的餐次为你选一道菜。</view><button class="decision-button" bindtap="dice">替我决定</button><view class="decision-meal">{{mealLabel ? '为你挑选 ' + mealLabel : '点击骰子，开始选餐'}}</view><view class="decision-tip"><view>吃完后想留记录？去“打卡”完成这一餐，再拍照留念。</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{randomDish}}" class="random-card" bindtap="openDish"><view class="eyebrow">{{mealLabel}} DICE RESULT</view><view class="random-name">{{randomDish.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{randomDish.canteenName}} · {{randomDish.stallName}}</view><view class="random-bottom"><text>¥{{randomDish.specialPrice || randomDish.price}}</text><text>去看看 ›</text></view></view></view></block></view>
